r_cache` won't be regenerated, perhaps this is not the only reason and there may be a better solution, and it seems to have little negative impact.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734043780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756171222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104252#issuecomment-2756171222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104252","id":2756171222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kR9XW","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T01:17:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T01:17:06Z","body":"This is the project  [mrp_nested_gltf_scene.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19477350/mrp_nested_gltf_scene.zip) I previously tested in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104252#discussion_r1998957503\r\n\r\nIn this project, after deleting .godot, setting the renderer, saving and restarting, the \"Couldn't save scene\" and confirm dialog will pop up. Then, after you select \"Cancel\", the editor will be no response if you try to restart or quit. It seems to be a bug in `_set_render_method_save_and_restart` or `restart_editor`\r\n\r\nFor now I prefer to keep using `restart_editor`.  ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2756171222/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761471960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104252#issuecomment-2761471960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104252","id":2761471960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kmLfY","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T14:06:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T14:06:28Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"ME